  Category: 0
  Prefab: {fileID: 6625514644646704096, guid: 66ca270a9c5bfc54492cc14d252c3e4e, type: 3}
  TextFields:
  - Nemean Lion
  - "A-\r\n \r\nJust finished up in St. Paul\u2014five stations down, five to go.
    Thinking of you, always. \u201CDoubt that the stars are fire, doubt that the
    sun doth move, doubt truth to be a liar. But never doubt I love.\u201D \r\n\r\nDid
    you know Leo is based on the Nemean lion? A monster of Greek myth, Hercules\u2019
    first task. The lion was supposed to be unkillable, with a coat made of solid
    gold. Hercules killed it with his bare hands. (Guess I\u2019m not that much like
    Hercules. I can barely kill a mosquito.)\r\n \r\nYou\u2019ve seen my notes, so
    you probably know why I\u2019ve been reading up on Leo lately. I just hope we
    can figure this out in time. We need to warn people. If anyone can do it, you
    can. \r\n\r\nBy the way, all the researchers in Duluth were talking about you\u2014the
    girl who came out of nowhere and started mapping the northern sky. The girl named
    after the gods. (Can\u2019t believe I didn\u2019t know this! Astrid: Beautiful
    god. Divinely beautiful. Your dad knew what he was doing when he named you, I
    guess.)\r\n \r\nMiss you, Astrid. (Insert both definitions here.)\r\n-E\r"
  StreamingVisuals:
  - VisualAssetPath: Postcards/leo_anim.webm
    LowResAssetPath: 
  - VisualAssetPath: Postcards/LOW_RES_Leo.png
    LowResAssetPath: Postcards/LOW_RES_Leo.png
  DefaultPinnedPos: {x: -1.15, y: 0, z: 0}
